        <mxCell id="insight" value="Repro objective: with identical outbound summarization rules, the SECONDARY hub intermittently drops ONE summary (order-dependent — reordering the rules changes which /16 or /17 goes missing), causing asymmetric routing. Validation: compare 'az network vhub route-map get-outbound-routes' on both VPN connections and 'birdc show route' on both NVAs — all 6 summaries (4×/16 + 2×/17) must appear on BOTH hubs." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fde7e9;strokeColor=#d13438;fontSize=12;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
